  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">3. M&#xE5;ls&#xE4;ttningen &#xE4;r kapacitetsf&#xF6;rb&#xE4;ttring hos UN-Habitat inom bostads- och infrastrukturekonomi f&#xF6;r att fylla Habitats normativa och katalytiska roll inom omr&#xE5;det.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the capacity-building support is to strengthen UN-HABITAT&apos;s long term capacity to fulfil its normative and catalytic roles in supporting the development of functioning local financial markets for housing and infrastructure investment and furthering the access of target groups to these markets in slum upgrading efforts.</narrative>
  </description>
